        "note": "SF.R12: Armed customs patrol corvette / interdiction cutter (class capital, never fielded in a ground arena) with hull, hold, and drive sections matching SpaceShipState::new_corvette so NPC corvettes and interdictors check out through custody from a real UnitSpec."
